    {
      "source": "Creates a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/parsing/BeanComponentDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.parsing\"><code>BeanComponentDefinition</code></a> from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionBuilder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionBuilder</code></a> and inspects the backing\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a>s id attribute for a name.",
